{"unit_id": "tag:0239:prose-0001", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n在概形（schemes）上的拓扑（topologies）这一章中（见拓扑（Topologies），第<REF_0001>节），我们介绍了概形（schemes）的扎里斯基（Zariski）、平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）、fppf、光滑（smooth）、合成（syntomic）和fpqc覆盖（fpqc coverings）。本章讨论概形（schemes）上的何种结构（structures）可以通过这样的覆盖（coverings）下降（descended）。例如，见<REF_0002>、<REF_0003>、<REF_0004>、<REF_0005>、<REF_0006>及<REF_0007>。本章也旨在介绍下降（descent）、下降（descent）数据（data）、有效（effective）下降（descent）数据（data）的概念，以拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaves）、概形（schemes）等的下降（descent）问题为较不形式化的背景。形式化的概念，即位点（site）上的栈（stack），在栈（stacks）这一章中讨论（见栈（Stacks），第<REF_0008>节）。\n\n", "allowed_english": ["fppf"], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "topologies", "target_term": "拓扑"}, {"source_term": "Topologies", "target_term": "拓扑"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "Zariski", "target_term": "扎里斯基"}, {"source_term": "étale", "target_term": "平展"}, {"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑"}, {"source_term": "syntomic", "target_term": "合成"}, {"source_term": "fpqc coverings", "target_term": "fpqc覆盖"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "structures", "target_term": "结构"}, {"source_term": "coverings", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "descended", "target_term": "下降"}, {"source_term": "descent", "target_term": "下降"}, {"source_term": "descent", "target_term": "下降"}, {"source_term": "data", "target_term": "数据"}, {"source_term": "effective", "target_term": "有效"}, {"source_term": "descent", "target_term": "下降"}, {"source_term": "data", "target_term": "数据"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaves", "target_term": "拟凝聚层"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "descent", "target_term": "下降"}, {"source_term": "site", "target_term": "位点"}, {"source_term": "stack", "target_term": "栈"}, {"source_term": "stacks", "target_term": "栈"}, {"source_term": "Stacks", "target_term": "栈"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_ter