{"unit_id": "tag:023A:title", "translation": "拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaves）的下降（Descent）数据（data）", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaves", "target_term": "拟凝聚层"}, {"source_term": "Descent", "target_term": "下降"}, {"source_term": "data", "target_term": "数据"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaves", "target_term": "拟凝聚层", "context": "本节下降对象。"}, {"source_term": "Descent", "target_term": "下降", "context": "标题中的下降。"}, {"source_term": "data", "target_term": "数据", "context": "标题中的下降数据。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:023A:prose-0001", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n本章采用如下约定：投影（projection）映射（maps）<MATH_0001>从<MATH_0002>开始编号。因此有<MATH_0003>、<MATH_0004>等。\n\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "projection", "target_term": "投影"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "projection", "target_term": "投影", "context": "积的投影。"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射", "context": "积的投影映射。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:023B:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是一个概形（scheme）。设<MATH_0002>是态射族（family of morphisms），其目标（target）为<MATH_0003>。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002>相对于所给族（family），一个<TEXTITOPEN_0001>用于拟凝聚层（for quasi-coherent sheaves）的下降数据（descent datum）<MATH_0004><TEXTITCLOSE_0001>由拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaf）<MATH_0005>（在<MATH_0006>上，对每个<MATH_0007>给定一个）以及拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）<MATH_0008>-模（modules）的同构（isomorphism）<MATH_0009>（对每一对（pair）<MATH_0010>给定一个）构成，使得对每个指标（indices）三元组（triple）<MATH_0011>，图（diagram）\n<MATH_0012>\n在<MATH_0013>-模（modules）中交换（commutes）。这称为<TEXTITOPEN_0002>余循环条件（cocycle condition）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>。\n<STRUCT_0003>一个<TEXTITOPEN_0003>下降数据的（of descent data）态射（morphism）<MATH_0014><TEXTITCLOSE_0003>由族（family）<MATH_0015>给出，它由<MATH_0016>-模（modules）的态射（morphisms）<MATH_0017>构成，使所有图（diagrams）\n<MATH_0018>\n都交换（commute）。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "family of morphisms", "target_term": "态射族"}, {"source_term": "target", "target_term": "目标"}, {"source_term": "family", "target_term": "族"}, {"source_term": "for quasi-coherent sheaves", "target_term": "用于拟凝聚层"}, {"source_term": "descent datum", "target_term": "下降数据"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf", "target_term": "拟凝聚层"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "pair", "target_term": "对"}, {"source_term": "indices", "target_term": "指标"}, {"source_term": "triple", "target_term": "三元组"}, {"source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "commutes", "target_term": "交换"}, {"source_term": "cocycle condition", "target_term": "余循环条件"}, {"source_term": "of descent data", "target_term": "下降数据的"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "family", "target_term": "族"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "diagrams", "target_term": "图"}, {"source_term": "commute", "target_term": "交换"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "下降的底概形。"}, {"source_term": "family of morphisms", "target_term": "态射族", "context": "同目标态射族。"}, {"source_term": "target", "target_term": "目标", "context": "共同目标。"}, {"source_term": "family", "target_term": "族", "context": "所给族及态射族。"}, {"source_term": "for quasi-coherent sheaves", "target_term": "用于拟凝聚层", "context": "受保护声明中的完整短语。"}, {"source_term": "descent datum", "target_term": "下降数据", "context": "定义所给的数据。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf", "target_term": "拟凝聚层", "context": "各源概形上的层。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚", "context": "模的性质。"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "结构层上的模。"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构", "context": "积上层的同构。"}, {"source_term": "pair", "target_term": "对", "context": "两个指标的配对。"}, {"source_term": "indices", "target_term": "指标", "context": "余循环条件的指标。"}, {"source_term": "triple", "target_term": "三元组", "context": "三个指标。"}, {"source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图", "context": "余循环图。"}, {"source_term": "commutes", "target_term": "交换", "context": "余循环图交换。"}, {"source_term": "cocycle condition", "target_term": "余循环条件", "context": "三重积上的相容条件。"}, {"source_term": "of descent data", "target_term": "下降数据的", "context": "受保护声明中的完整短语。"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "下降数据的态射。"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "各分量模的态射。"}, {"source_term": "diagrams", "target_term": "图", "context": "态射相容性图。"}, {"source_term": "commute", "target_term": "交换", "context": "态射相容性图交换。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:023A:prose-0002", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n下面是一个值得记住的例子。假设<MATH_0001>是开（open）覆盖（covering）。在此情形下，我们已在层（Sheaves），第<REF_0001>节中见过集合（sets）的层（sheaves）的下降（descent）数据（data），在那里称之为“相对于给定覆盖（covering）的集合（sets）的层（sheaves）的粘合（glueing）数据（data）”。此外，我们证明了粘合（glueing）数据（data）的范畴（category）等价（equivalent）于<MATH_0002>上的层（sheaves）的范畴（category）。当<MATH_0003>是一个fpqc覆盖（fpqc covering）时，将在上述背景下证明类似结论。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n在覆盖（covering）<MATH_0004>由<MATH_0005>给出的极端情形下，下降（descent）数据（datum）必定具有<MATH_0006>的形式。余循环条件（cocycle condition）保证<MATH_0007>上的恒等（identity）是此时唯一允许的映射（map）。特别地，下面的引理表明，每个拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaf），其为<MATH_0008>-模（modules），都对应于相对于任意给定族（family）的唯一下降（descent）数据（datum）。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "Sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "descent", "target_term": "下降"}, {"source_term": "data", "target_term": "数据"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "glueing", "target_term": "粘合"}, {"source_term": "data", "target_term": "数据"}, {"source_term": "glueing", "target_term": "粘合"}, {"source_term": "data", "target_term": "数据"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "fpqc covering", "target_term": "fpqc覆盖"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "descent", "target_term": "下降"}, {"source_term": "datum", "target_term": "数据"}, {"source_term": "cocycle condition", "target_term": "余循环条件"}, {"source_term": "identity", "target_term": "恒等"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf", "target_term": "拟凝聚层"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "family", "target_term": "族"}, {"source_term": "descent", "target_term": "下降"}, {"source_term": "datum", "target_term": "数据"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开", "context": "开覆盖的限定。"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖", "context": "开覆盖、给定覆盖及平凡覆盖。"}, {"source_term": "Sheaves", "target_term": "层", "context": "引用章名。"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合", "context": "集合值层。"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层", "context": "集合值层及其范畴。"}, {"source_term": "descent", "target_term": "下降", "context": "下降数据的限定。"}, {"source_term": "data", "target_term": "数据", "context": "下降数据及粘合数据。"}, {"source_term": "glueing", "target_term": "粘合", "context": "层的粘合数据。"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴", "context": "粘合数据与层的范畴。"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价", "context": "范畴关系。"}, {"source_term": "fpqc covering", "target_term": "fpqc覆盖", "context": "下降结论的覆盖条件。"}, {"source_term": "datum", "target_term": "数据", "context": "所给或关联的一个下降数据。"}, {"source_term": "cocycle condition", "target_term": "余循环条件", "context": "下降数据相容条件。"}, {"source_term": "identity", "target_term": "恒等", "context": "平凡覆盖上唯一的映射。"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "结构映射。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf", "target_term": "拟凝聚层", "context": "底概形上的层。"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "结构层上的模。"}, {"source_term": "family", "target_term": "族", "context": "任意给定的族。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:023C:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>与<MATH_0002>是概形（schemes）的态射族（families of morphisms），具有固定目标（fixed target）。设<MATH_0003>是固定目标（fixed target）的映射（maps）族（families）的一个态射（morphism），见位点（Sites），定义<REF_0001>。设<MATH_0004>是拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaves）的一个下降（descent）数据（datum），相对于族（family）<MATH_0005>。则\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002>系统（system）<MATH_0006>是相对于族（family）<MATH_0007>的一个下降（descent）数据（datum）。\n<STRUCT_0003>此构造关于下降（descent）数据（datum）<MATH_0008>具有函子性（functorial）。\n<STRUCT_0004>给定第二个态射（morphism）<MATH_0009>，属于固定目标（fixed target）的映射（maps）族（families），且<MATH_0010>，则存在下降（descent）数据（data）的具有函子性（functorial）的同构（isomorphism）\n<MATH_0011>\n<STRUCT_0005>\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "families of morphisms", "target_term": "态射族"}, {"source_term": "fixed target", "target_term": "固定目标"}, {"source_term": "fixed target", "target_term": "固定目标"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "families", "target_term": "族"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "Sites", "target_term": "位点"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaves", "target_term": "拟凝聚层"}, {"source_term": "descent", "target_term": "下降"}, {"source_term": "datum", "target_term": "数据"}, {"source_term": "family", "target_term": "族"}, {"source_term": "system", "target_term": "系统"}, {"source_term": "family", "target_term": "族"}, {"source_term": "descent", "target_term": "下降"}, {"source_term": "datum", "target_term": "数据"}, {"source_term": "descent", "target_term": "下降"}, {"source_term": "datum", "target_term": "数据"}, {"source_term": "functorial", "target_term": "函子性"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "fixed target", "target_term": "固定目标"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "families", "target_term": "族"}, {"source_term": "descent", "target_term": "下降"}, {"source_term": "data", "target_term": "数据"}, {"source_term": "functorial", "target_term": "函子性"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "族的源与目标。"}, {"source_term": "families of morphisms", "target_term": "态射族", "context": "同目标的态射族。"}, {"source_term": "fixed target", "target_term": "固定目标", "context": "族态射的目标限定。"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射", "context": "固定目标映射族。"}, {"source_term": "families", "target_term": "族", "context": "固定目标映射的族。"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "两族之间的态射。"}, {"source_term": "Sites", "target_term": "位点", "context": "引用章名。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaves", "target_term": "拟凝聚层", "context": "下降数据的对象。"}, {"source_term": "descent", "target_term": "下降", "context": "下降数据限定。"}, {"source_term": "datum", "target_term": "数据", "context": "给定或构造的一个下降数据。"}, {"source_term": "family", "target_term": "族", "context": "相对下降的族。"}, {"source_term": "system", "target_term": "系统", "context": "构造的层与同构系统。"}, {"source_term": "functorial", "target_term": "函子性", "context": "构造及同构的函子性。"}, {"source_term": "data", "target_term": "数据", "context": "同构所比较的下降数据。"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构", "context": "两种拉回的同构。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:023C:proof", "translation": "省略。提示：映射（maps）\n<MATH_0001>\n给出第(3)项中下降（descent）数据（data）的同构（isomorphism）；它们是映射（maps）<MATH_0002>沿态射（morphisms）<MATH_0003>的拉回（pullbacks）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "descent", "target_term": "下降"}, {"source_term": "data", "target_term": "数据"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "pullbacks", "target_term": "拉回"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射", "context": "给出同构的映射。"}, {"source_term": "descent", "target_term": "下降", "context": "下降数据的限定。"}, {"source_term": "data", "target_term": "数据", "context": "第(3)项的下降数据。"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构", "context": "第(3)项的同构。"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "拉回所沿的态射。"}, {"source_term": "pullbacks", "target_term": "拉回", "context": "映射的拉回。"}], "notes": ["remark：原文省略证明，仅给出提示，忠实保留，不补证明。"]}
{"unit_id": "tag:023A:prose-0003", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n任意族（family）<MATH_0001>都以唯一的方式成为平凡（trivial）覆盖（covering）<MATH_0002>的加细（refinement）。对于拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaf）<MATH_0003>（在<MATH_0004>上），用<MATH_0005>简记由上述过程得到的相对于<MATH_0006>的下降（descent）数据（datum）。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "family", "target_term": "族"}, {"source_term": "trivial", "target_term": "平凡"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "refinement", "target_term": "加细"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf", "target_term": "拟凝聚层"}, {"source_term": "descent", "target_term": "下降"}, {"source_term": "datum", "target_term": "数据"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "family", "target_term": "族", "context": "任意同目标态射族。"}, {"source_term": "trivial", "target_term": "平凡", "context": "平凡覆盖的限定。"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖", "context": "恒等态射的覆盖。"}, {"source_term": "refinement", "target_term": "加细", "context": "相对于平凡覆盖的加细。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf", "target_term": "拟凝聚层", "context": "底概形上的层。"}, {"source_term": "descent", "target_term": "下降", "context": "关联的下降数据。"}, {"source_term": "datum", "target_term": "数据", "context": "规范下降数据。"}], "notes": []}
